  "releaseNotes": "v1.5.1: documentation and packaging patch - every public member now carries XML documentation (CS1591 is enforced as a build error) and the README was reviewed for accuracy. Previous release: v1.5.0 - Redis options are validated at registration - a bad host, port, database or timeout throws InvalidOperationException immediately instead of turning every read into a silent miss. The [CacheAside]/[InvalidateCache] metadata attributes were removed from LinKit.Core 4.0.0; call ICacheProvider.GetOrCreateAsync/RemoveAsync explicitly. Full documentation & release notes: https://quoclinh.id.vn/docs/linkit",
